OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurder after man shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man was
OL,8,Ffound shot dead in a woodland in
OL,9,FSheffield, police have said.
OL,11,FThe man, who is yet to be identified,
OL,12,Fwas found in Ecclesall Woods at about
OL,13,F18:45 BST on Wednesday by a member of
OL,14,Fthe public.
OL,16,FSouth Yorkshire Police said a
OL,17,Fpost-mortem examination had revealed he
OL,18,Fdied as a result of a gunshot wound and
OL,19,Fthat the investigation into what had
OL,20,Fhappened "continues at pace".
